; Module order for the game build = memory order of the final image.
; tools/build_exolon.py concatenates these into build/exolon.mac and
; assembles them with bin/macro11.  boot.mac must stay first (it pads
; itself to 1000, where main.mac's MAIN_START region begins); nothing
; may sit between ppu.mac's PP_START and ppu_end.mac's PP_END (that
; block, music data included, is copied into PPU RAM); gamevars.mac
; and tail.mac close the layout.
src/defs.mac
src/gamevars.mac
src/boot.mac
src/main.mac
src/flow.mac
src/zone.mac
src/list.mac
src/player.mac
src/shots.mac
src/enemy.mac
src/anims.mac
src/gate.mac
src/hud.mac
src/input.mac
src/gfx.mac
src/ppucomm.mac
src/ppu.mac
build/data_music.mac
src/ppu_end.mac
build/data_tiles.mac
build/data_lists.mac
build/data_zones.mac
build/data_sprites.mac
build/strings.mac
src/tail.mac
